    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gallagher Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this newly refurbished three bedroom detached house. The property is presented in excellent decorative order throughout. Located only a 10 minute drive from Carrick on Shannon. Accommodation comprises of entrance hall, open plan kitchen/diner/reception area with brand new fitted kitchen, shower room and three bedrooms, the master bedroom benefits of ensuite bathroom & patio doors leading out to the garden area. The property benefits of oil fired central heating, solid fuel stove, ample parking & fuel shed. Viewings strictly by appointment with Gallagher Auctioneers Ltd."
      },
